---
/**
 * The case for the framework: what every AI product rebuilds, why a good
 * agent still gets it wrong, and what changes against the plan you would
 * otherwise follow.
 */
import Page from "@/layouts/Page.astro";
import { ScrollLedger } from "@/components/scroll-ledger";
import { BlockerCards } from "@/components/blocker-cards";
import { Alternatives } from "@/components/alternatives";
---
<Page
  path="/why"
  tag="why intelligo"
  title="The half you keep rebuilding,<br />and why a good agent doesn't fix it."
  lede="The recurring problems behind every AI product — who is signed in, what their plan allows, what a run cost, who to bill, what to tell an auditor — and why they belong in a dependency, not in a prompt."
  description="Why Intelligo exists: the undifferentiated 70% of every AI SaaS, why a well-prompted agent still gets it wrong, and how it compares to the alternatives."
>
  <nav aria-label="On this page" class="xline">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 px-6 py-5 md:px-10">
      <a href="#capabilities" class="mono text-[0.78rem] text-foreground/70 no-underline hover:text-foreground">the other half</a>
      <a href="#agents" class="mono text-[0.78rem] text-foreground/70 no-underline hover:text-foreground">the agent objection</a>
      <a href="#compare" class="mono text-[0.78rem] text-foreground/70 no-underline hover:text-foreground">compared to the alternatives</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section id="capabilities" class="xline">
    <div class="px-6 py-10 md:px-10 md:py-14">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="tag">the other half, counted</span>
        <h2>Every line is a service or surface<br />that exists in the packages today.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <ScrollLedger client:visible />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="agents" class="xline">
    <div class="px-6 py-10 md:px-10 md:py-14">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="tag">the agent objection</span>
        <h2>Your agent is good.<br />It doesn't know what it doesn't know.</h2>
        <p>Three ways a well-prompted coding agent still gets the boring half wrong — and what shipping it finished changes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4">
        <BlockerCards client:visible />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="compare" class="xline">
    <div class="px-6 py-10 md:px-10 md:py-14">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="tag">compared to the alternatives</span>
        <h2>Not a boilerplate.<br />Not an agent platform.</h2>
        <p>Pick the plan you'd otherwise follow and see what changes — what you keep, what you drop.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <Alternatives client:visible />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>
